  "why_this_one": "Lorencia's first kill and the smallest thing in the game: Monster10.bmd at 0.4, two sheets (32x64 legs, 64x64 body), seven actions, no effects in MU. Rebuilt from MU's data on 2026-10-12 to prove the Cooker's research, scaffold and checklist flow end to end.",
